## Reviewer points not applied

- a#2. The URL pcode=G0340028&flno=3 is the Business Tax Act (加值型及非加值型營業稅法), not the nonresident dividend withholding rule. English 004 names that Act; the visible "artikkel 10" matches the English label even though the URL's flno is 3. 001 Estonian already says "Säte mitteresidendile makstava dividendi kinnipidamismäära kohta", which does not match 001 English ("General Business Tax Rate"). That label was not copied onto 004, and 001 was left because rewriting it was not a valid finding.
- Space as the Estonian thousands separator, and currency after the amount, is the native norm. The et number checker cannot parse a space (R14). Amounts stay "TWD 500.000" / "TWD 1.579.589".
- "TWD 1.57M" is pinned. The suggested "1,57 miljonit TWD" was not applied.
- "Alates 1. juulist 2026" is natural Estonian. The checker only maps the nominative "juuli", so the elative drops month 7. July dates stay "1. juuli 2026".
- "ühe poole nimele" / "ühe aasta" / "ühe korra" / "ühe päeva" / "ühe staažiaasta" drop a counted digit 1. Digits were kept.
- Turning Q16–Q20 into headings, and deleting U+200B blanks, would fail headings, blocks, and ZWSP parity with the Korean source.
- Hangul slugs in url (008, 009) were not edited.
- b#17 "ja mõju asenduspärimisele" makes the next rank and representation cumulative. English is "or". The Estonian keeps "või".
- b#34 "haldusraha" is ordinary administrative money. The file's legal term for 罰鍰 is haldusrahve; that term was kept.
- "lapse parimad huvid" is the statutory best-interests test. Left.
